==English==

===Etymology 1===
{{PIE word|en|dwóh₁}}
From {{inh|en|enm|twig}}, {{m|enm|twyg}}, from {{inh|en|ang|twiġ}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*twīgą}} (compare {{cog|fy|twiich}}, {{cog|nl|twijg}}, {{cog|de|Zweig}}), from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*dweygʰom}} (compare {{cog|cu|двигъ||branch}}, {{cog|sq|degë||branch}}), from {{m|ine-pro|*dwóh₁}}. More at [[two]].

